#: scenario8:scenario8_5AD2E860_A5D1_4D0E_A441_21ED1B447000
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c5e571f0ab753327b779f2b548a3a62849036155ed3bc27d517b789188f612a
